  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to make your very presence a soothing balm. You move up to your Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks, and when you move within 5 feet of any other creature during this action, you can restore Hit Points to it equal to 2d6 plus your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1). A creature can receive this healing only once each time you take this action.</p>",
